delay 4
lyric Hey, look, down here!
delay 4
lyric Welcome to the pyDDR beginner tutorial. 
trans (instructions will be here!)
delay 6 
lyric See the platform under your feet? 
delay 6 
lyric When moving arrows cross over the ones at the top....  
delay 6 
trans ....you hit corresponding arrows on the platform. 
delay 8 
lyric So, get ready to tap the left arrow.. 
delay 3.75
lyric ...Now! 
delay 0.25 
halfn 08 00 00 00 
lyric Don't go back to the center; stay on the left arrow. 
delay 4 
lyric Now, note your "judging" in the middle. 
delay 4 
lyric At the end of a song, these are added up. 
delay 4 
lyric Your grade depends on how close to the beat you dance. 
delay 6
lyric Here comes another arrow. 
delay 3 
lyric Remember to stay on the left arrow, 
delay 3 
lyric then tap the right when it's covering the top arrow..
delay 3.75 
trans ..now! 
delay 0.25 
whole 00 00 00 08 
lyric Okay, now a more tricky technique (sort of). 
delay 6 
lyric Let's try hitting the down and up arrow at the same time. 
delay 6 
lyric You will need to jump to hit two arrows at once. Ready?
delay 3.5 
lyric Jump!
delay 0.5
whole 00 08 08 00
lyric By now you might have a combo.
delay 4
lyric A combo is consecutive marvelous/great/perfect steps.
delay 6
lyric Now let's try a "march". Here's how:
delay 4
lyric You will probably start standing on both left and right,
delay 6
lyric and then "waddle" between the two.
delay 4
qurtr 08 00 00 00
qurtr 00 00 00 08
qurtr 08 00 00 00
qurtr 00 00 00 08
qurtr 08 00 00 00
qurtr 00 00 00 08
lyric Now you can see why returning to the center....
delay 6
trans ..might be a bad idea.
delay 4
lyric Arrows can appear in any order, like these.
delay 4
lyric Be prepared to move a free foot to the next arrow.
delay 6
qurtr 00 00 08 00
qurtr 08 00 00 00
qurtr 00 08 00 00
qurtr 00 00 00 08
qurtr 00 00 08 00
