lyric On a final note, some tips:
delay 6
lyric Remember that arrows are hit to the beat.
delay 6
lyric Bounce to the beat if it helps.
delay 6
lyric Also look at the number of bars in the song selector.
delay 6
lyric More bars means a harder song.
delay 4
lyric Try a one-bar song first.
delay 4
lyric Last but not least, everything is patterns, like these.
delay 6
lyric Recognising them is the key.
